'''Platform five''' was a location in [[Tipoca City]] on [[Kamino]]. Early in the [[Imperial Era]], members of [[Clone Force 99]] entered the [[city]] via the platform while attempting to [[Rescue of Hunter|rescue]] their leader, [[Hunter]], from the [[Galactic Empire]]. The platform was destroyed not long afterwards when the Empire [[Attack on Kamino|destroyed]] the city via bombardment after stripping it of valuable [[cloning]] technology and essential personnel.<ref name="Return to Kamino" />

